==Trivia==
*Ancient Forest Labyrinth's Japanese name, Kodaiju no Meikyū (古代樹の迷宮, "Labyrinth of Ancient Trees"), may be a reference to ''Sekaiju no Meikyū'' (世界樹の迷宮, "Labyrinth of the World Tree"), the Japanese name of the dungeon crawler RPG series [[wikipedia:Etrian Odyssey|''Etrian Odyssey'']].
*Ancient Forest Labyrinth shares its map image with [[Laboratory of Relics]] and a couple other sub-chapters, which may be why it is the sub-chapter invaded by [[Idi:Ne]].
**It could also be because [[Elder Flame Doron]] and Idi:Ne both spawn many times throughout [[The Face of God]] and its [[The Face of God/Invasion|invasion]].
*The Face of God Invasion is the only stage in Ancient Forest Labyrinth to have no enemies that create [[Surge Attack]]s.
*The Face of God Invasion and [[Revival of Origin/Invasion|Revival of Origin Invasion]] are the only Uncanny Legends stages to have [[Base Barrier]]s.
*This subchapter had all it's stages changed in [[Version 15.3 Update|Update 15.3]], the first 5 stages had their lengths increased by 100, while [[The Face of God]] had [[Elder Mask Doron (Special Cat)|its drop]] changed from 3% to 30% chance

